# Two of those PASS rows are resources the policy did NOT touch.
# The NSG supports allLogs and not audit. No built-in policy covers
# storage accounts at any category group. Both look like failures on
# a compliance dashboard and neither is.
#
# The last row is the only one that proves data moved. Everything
# above it proves configuration.
